      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'd be happy to help you draft a formal email to your tenants. Here's a sample email that conveys the necessary information in a professional and apologetic tone:\n\nSubject: Notification of HVAC Maintenance and Temporary Temperature Fluctuations\n\nDear valued tenants,\n\nAs we continue to ensure the optimal functioning of our Tokyo office tower, our facilities team will be performing routine maintenance on the HVAC system this weekend. Unfortunately, this will result in temporary fluctuations in the building's temperature, which may cause some discomfort for our occupants.\n\nPlease be assured that we are taking all necessary precautions to minimize disruptions and ensure a smooth maintenance process. Our team will work diligently to complete the work as quickly as possible, and we appreciate your understanding and patience during this time.\n\nWe understand that this may cause some inconvenience, and we want to assure you that we are doing everything in our power to minimize the impact. Our facilities team is working around the clock to ensure that the building remains comfortable and safe for all occupants.\n\nIf you have any specific concerns or requests, please do not hesitate to reach out to our facilities team. We are always here to assist you and appreciate your cooperation in this matter.\n\nThank you for your understanding, and we look forward to completing the maintenance work as",
