      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start, but could you make it sound a bit more \"human\" and less like a template? maybe add a line about how we know the temperature changes can feel a bit unpredictable or out of control, but that it's just part of the system being recalibrated. just something to acknowledge the weirdness of the air behaving strangely.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a revised version with a more human tone and a nod to the unpredictable nature of the temperature fluctuations:\n\nSubject: Notification of HVAC Maintenance and Temporary Temperature Fluctuations\n\nDear tenants,\n\nI wanted to personally reach out to you all to let you know that our facilities team will be performing routine maintenance on the HVAC system this weekend. As you may have noticed, the temperature in the building can sometimes feel a bit...unpredictable, like a mischievous goblin lurking in the ductwork, causing the thermostat to dance with the temperature. But rest assured, this is just a normal part of the system being recalibrated, and our team is working to get everything back to normal as soon as possible.\n\nWe understand that this may cause some discomfort, and we want to assure you that we're doing everything in our power to minimize the impact. Our team will be working around the clock to ensure that the building remains comfortable and safe for all occupants. We appreciate your patience and understanding as we work to get the system back under control.\n\nIf you have any specific concerns or requests, please don't hesitate to reach out to our facilities team. We're always here to listen and help in any way we can.\n\nThank you for your understanding,",
